{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And destroy.</b> Like ובלע את הקודש (Numbers 4:20), in the sense of uncovered." "<b>The covering.</b> Like וילט פניו באדרתו (1 Kings 19:13); its meaning is like מסכה, and it is like מכסה, like והמסכה צרה כהתכנס (Isaiah 28:20)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {1 "The quoted form מכס' appears with an abbreviation mark; resolved as מכסה based on the parallel with מסכה."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:06.610380723Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}